-- title:
--   Decoding the refined actual joint measurement recovers the complete old option-valued POVM, including its malformed effect
-- statement:
--   A statement of the module `MIPRE.Foundations.Introspection.AdaptiveSelectedMeasurement` of the MIP\* = RE formalization (commit `70cbf1c` of vidick/MIPRE-formalization). The actual selected measurement before an adaptive replacement. The local updating decoder recovers the old option-valued measurement on each prefix branch. Reassembly therefore recovers the full ambient option measurement. Canonicalization turns this into exactly the raw selected measurement required by the quantitative replacement theorem. No malformed effect is assumed to vanish.
--
